  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.upessc.up.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pardesh Secondary Education Services Selection Board (UPSESSB)</a> </span>has released the answer key for selection to the posts of Trained Graduate Teacher (TGT) the Advt. No. 01/2022. The vacancy came in the year 2022 and it took almost two years to conduct the written examination for the prescribed posts. The written examination was held on 03 – 04 June 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their UP TGT Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pardesh Secondary Education Services Selection Board (UPSESSB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP TGT Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSESSB UP TGT Advt No. : 01/2022</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>09 June 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>09 June 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>10 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>13 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Form Submit Last Date :<strong> 16 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <b>03 – 04 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>23 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>30 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>06 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC Candidates&nbsp;:<strong> Rs.750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">EWS Candidates : <strong>Rs. 650</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC Candidates :<strong>&nbsp;Rs.450/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC Candidates :<strong>&nbsp;Rs.250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PH Candidates :<strong>&nbsp;Rs.375/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP TGT Notification 2022 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :NA</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP TGT / PGT 2022&nbsp;: Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 3539 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2868%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5781%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2868%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Trained Graduate Teacher TGT (Balak)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3213</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5781%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3539</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2868%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Trained Graduate Teacher TGT (Balika)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">326</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP TGT Bharti 2022 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.4049%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.5951%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.4049%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Trained Graduate Teacher (TGT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.5951%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduate Degree in Related Subject and B.Ed From Recognized University.&nbsp;will be eligible for these posts.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Complete details –&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/up-tgt-eligibility-SarkariExam.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP TGT Online Form 2022 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Interview</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UP TGT Answer Key 2026 </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their UP TGT Answer Key candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their UP TGT Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be are directed to the login page ,here they are required to provide their valid details-:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Roll Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Need to select their batch</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Have to click on the “Submit” Icon</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their valid details candidates will be able to download their UP TGT Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their UP TGT Answer Key from official site of the UPSESSB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align